Component Minimum Recommended Notes Web server Apache 2.4 / Nginx 1.18 Current stable URL rewriting is optional; flat PHP routes work without it. PHP 7.4 8.1 or 8.2 PDO MySQL is required. Database MySQL 5.7 / MariaDB 10.3 MySQL 8.0 <code>utf8mb4</code> is required for content. Disk Enough for code + uploads Backups on separate storage Slides and project images can grow quickly. HTTPS Recommended Required for production Protects admin sessions and login credentials. <p>Required PHP extensions:</p> Extension Why it is needed <code>pdo</code> Database abstraction. <code>pdo_mysql</code> MySQL driver used by <code>includes/config.php</code>. <code>json</code> API payloads, permissions, and plugin metadata. <code>mbstring</code> Multibyte strings in content and UI helpers. <code>session</code> Admin login and permission state. <code>fileinfo</code> Upload MIME detection. <code>zip</code> Installing plugins from a ZIP archive. <p><code>openssl</code> is recommended for HTTPS-aware deployments but is not required by the core request path. If <code>zip</code> is unavailable, manual plugin upload still works but the ZIP installer page will report a failed environment check.</p> <p>To inspect the active PHP configuration, create a temporary <code>phpinfo.php</code> in the web root:</p> <pre><code>&lt;?php
phpinfo();
</code></pre> <p>Open it in a browser, confirm <code>pdo_mysql</code> is enabled, then delete the file immediately. Do not leave <code>phpinfo.php</code> on a production server.</p>
